                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a199bf4f-e3a8-4a9a-8f01-9abbb52e862f",
                                "sense_id": "0fb11edf-d6b6-33ac-8141-8a22eb1b9de4",
                                "text": "Пожа́луй, мно́гие офице́ры да́же возмути́лись бы, узна́в, что она́ сме́ет отка́зывать пресла́вному Ахилле́су во взаи́мности и храни́т ве́рность како́му-то жа́лкому шифрова́льщику.",
                                "translation": "Many of the officers would probably have been quite indignant if they had discovered that she dared to refuse to enter into intimate relations with the glorious Russian Achilles and was remaining faithful to some lowly cryptographer.",
                                "english": "Many of the officers would probably have been quite indignant if they had discovered that she dared to refuse to enter into intimate relations with the glorious Russian Achilles and was remaining faithful to some lowly cryptographer."
                            }
                        ]
